# Customer Web → RN Parity

**Mission:** Make `HomeServices` (Customer React Native) match `homeServices-customer-web`. Web is source of truth.

## Standing prompt (full)
Read and follow: `docs/CUSTOMER_WEB_RN_PARITY_PROMPT.md`

## Before any UI change
1. Find matching page/CSS in `../homeServices-customer-web/`.
2. Map web → RN screen (table in the standing prompt).
3. Port via `src/fromWebCss/` + StyleSheet; approximate `color-mix` / glass.
4. Sync i18n (`src/i18n/locales/web/`); never show raw keys.
5. Honor `homeservices-backend` contracts — no invented API behavior.

## Non-negotiable
- Do not change `applicationId` `com.homeservices.customer`.
- Preserve multi-role handoff, auth (Mobile→PIN; OTP only signup/forgot), phone privacy.
- Do not remount tab navigators on theme/night-vision toggles.
- Prefer `sapvt-ltd-app-packages` before duplicating UI.
- User-first Hindi/English; no backend jargon.
